; ============================================================================
; MOM - gift capital and her own investment portfolio.
;
; Money from Self arrives as a gift from a relative: exempt in her hands
; u/s 56(2)(x), and NOT clubbed with Self (s.64 covers spouse and minor children,
; not parents). Income earned on it is hers. Transfers in are tagged #gift.
; ============================================================================

2020-01-01 open Assets:Mom:Savings                INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Mom:Clearing               INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Mom:FD                     INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Mom:MF:NiftyBees           NIFTYBEES

2020-01-01 open Income:Mom:Interest               INR
2020-01-01 open Income:Mom:CapitalGains           INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Uncategorized        INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Food:Groceries       INR
2020-01-01 open Equity:Mom:Opening-Balances       INR

; ---- Accounts the [[rules]] and the importer can post to
2020-01-01 open Income:Mom:Salary                      INR
2020-01-01 open Income:Mom:Cashback                    INR
2020-01-01 open Income:Mom:Uncategorized               INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Food:Dining               INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Transport:Fuel            INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Transport:Travel          INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Shopping                  INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Utilities                 INR
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Mom:Fees:Bank                 INR
2020-01-01 open Assets:Mom:Cash                        INR

; ---- Transactions appended by the scripts go below this line.
